00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:29.420
As they exorcised the spirits, I will give them their special reward

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:37.340
Although it was published as a hunting mission, the guild was worried that other new spirits would not stop appearing.

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:41.400
And with a lot of reason. Hey, tell us, why were there so many spirits?

00:19:41.900 --> 00:19:46.520
Well, it's very obvious. There is a community cemetery near the mansion, isn't it?

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:48.720
