00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:19.850
Yes.

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:25.710
So I assumed that they would end up leaving there if I blocked the house of the spirits, that is, the cemetery.

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:27.770
And that...

00:20:30.030 --> 00:20:31.630
